  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758556,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "Step into the world of espionage as James Bond in *007 - Quantum of Solace* for the Nintendo Wii! The game plunges you directly into the action following the events of *Casino Royale*, with Bond tasked with abducting Mr. White from his lakeside estate in Italy. Engage in thrilling combat sequences, rooftop chases, and intense interrogations as you uncover the secrets of Quantum, a shadowy organization unknown to MI6.\n\nThe Wii version delivers a unique and engaging experience, featuring split-screen multiplayer for up to four players locally. Connect online with friends and compete in four distinct modes – Conflict, Rush, Team Conflict, and Team Rush – each rated using a familiar Mario Kart Wii system. Customize your online persona with Miis and utilize Friend Codes to create exclusive gaming experiences. Experience the cinematic storyline and visceral combat, all while leveraging the Wii's motion controls for immersive gameplay. Prepare to infiltrate, interrogate, and eliminate in this action-packed adventure!"
    },
